# Flow-focusing droplet generator.
#
# A dispersed phase entering from the top is squeezed between two continuous-
# phase streams and forced through a narrow orifice, which breaks it into
# droplets. The orifice is built from dimension markers on one segment rather
# than as a separate short channel, so the solid generator lofts a smooth neck
# instead of stepping between two constant channels.

chip "Flow-focusing droplet generator"
printer standard-4k
size 40 x 50
base 4
wall 2
edge-spacing 3
split two-piece at 2
channel 0.6 x 0.4 rect

port dispersed at 20,44 luer-slip inlet water 5
port oilLeft   at 7,32  luer-slip inlet oil 15
port oilRight  at 33,32 luer-slip inlet oil 15
port outlet    at 20,8  luer-lock outlet

node cross  at 20,32
node throat at 20,28
node relax  at 20,20

path dispersed -> cross
path oilLeft   -> cross
path oilRight  -> cross

# The throat: 0.6 mm in, pinched to 0.35 mm at 45% along, released to 0.9 mm.
path cross -> throat taper 0.6x0.4@0 0.35x0.3@0.45 0.9x0.5@1
path throat -> relax  taper 0.9x0.5@0 1.2x0.6@1
path relax -> outlet  width 1.2x0.6
